# CODEOWNERS snippet -- the zone readiness attestation (KDEC-036 G1, owner ruling 2026-11-03).
# Add these lines to the application repository's .github/CODEOWNERS, and in the default branch's
# protection (or ruleset) require a pull request, require code-owner review, and do not let
# administrators bypass. Then the only way the attestation changes is a pull request an AppSec
# reviewer approved -- which is what the deploy checks before login at uat and prod.
#
# Replace @your-org/appsec with the AppSec team. Its members are the people the central policy
# register's AppSec approver list (approver_lists.appsec, GitHub logins) names: the deploy matches the
# approving reviewer's login against that list, because the job's token cannot read team membership.

/.kit/zone-readiness.json       @your-org/appsec
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @your-org/appsec @your-org/platform
